    "overview": "Warm paper, paprika ink, and pale desk materials frame an editorial browsing experience. Local source-native SVG still lifes establish the product world; familiar controls keep cart and simulated checkout practical. This is an original fictional identity, with shadcn research informing control discipline only.",
